# Top-level requirements of the VibroAgent-Gemma environment (vibrodiag_mcp_prototype/.run/vibrogemma-venv).
# constraints/gemma.txt is compiled from this file and pins the full dependency closure, so a
# fresh install resolves to the same versions every time instead of whatever is newest that day.
#
# numpy is resolved here but not emitted: setup_geniex.sh installs numpy==2.2.6 for the encoder,
# and the live/offline modes then install the STDATALOG pin numpy==2.3.4. Both are exact already.
#
# Regenerate (then re-run the test suite before committing):
#   uv pip compile VibroAgent-Gemma/constraints/gemma.in --universal --python-version 3.12 \
#       --no-header --no-emit-package numpy \
#       -o VibroAgent-Gemma/constraints/gemma.txt

